  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 71538442a108cf245bf5b66c9780c8da, type: 3}
  m_Name: Turtle
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: Unknown
  speakerNameVietnamese: 
  speakerAvatar: {fileID: 0}
  lines:
  - 'I am still waiting for my elder brother to return.

    Tell me... have you
    seen an old tortoise on your journey?'
  - 'The humans took him away.

    Those wretched mortals...'
  - 'Stay away from humans, little one.

    And from the monsters as well.'
  - 'Especially the Orcs...

    They will tear apart and devour anything that still
    draws breath.

    Stay vigilant.'
  vietnameseLines:
  - "Ta v\u1EABn \u0111ang ch\u1EDD ng\u01B0\u1EDDi anh trai c\u1EE7a ta tr\u1EDF
    v\u1EC1.\nNg\u01B0\u01A1i... \u0111\xE3 t\u1EEBng nh\xECn th\u1EA5y m\u1ED9t
    con r\xF9a gi\xE0 n\xE0o tr\xEAn h\xE0nh tr\xECnh c\u1EE7a m\xECnh ch\u01B0a?"
  - "Lo\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE3 b\u1EAFt huynh \u1EA5y \u0111i.\nL\u0169
    ph\xE0m nh\xE2n kh\u1ED1n ki\u1EBFp..."
  - "H\xE3y tr\xE1nh xa lo\xE0i ng\u01B0\u1EDDi, c\u1EADu b\xE9.\nV\xE0 c\u1EA3 l\u0169
    qu\xE1i v\u1EADt n\u1EEFa.\n\u0110\u1EB7c bi\u1EC7t l\xE0 b\u1ECDn Orc...\nCh\xFAng
    s\u1EBD x\xE9 x\xE1c v\xE0 nu\u1ED1t ch\u1EEDng b\u1EA5t c\u1EE9 th\u1EE9 g\xEC
    c\xF2n bi\u1EBFt c\u1EED \u0111\u1ED9ng.\nH\xE3y lu\xF4n c\u1EA9n th\u1EADn."
